      "amount": 1
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the butter in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and onion, sauté for about 3 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Pour in vegetable broth, add brine-dried danmuji, salt, and black pepper. Stir well to combine.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 20 minutes or until the rice is tender.",
    "Turn off heat, cover with a lid, let it rest for 10 minutes.",
    "Fluff with a fork and serve hot."
